Therapist: Hey Jordan, I know you said you only had a minute before your next meeting — what's going on?
Client: Yeah, sorry, work is insane today. I just wanted to say the new sleep schedule is actually working okay so far.
Therapist: That's great to hear. No issues to flag before you go?
Client: No, I'm good. Can we just keep our regular time next week?
Therapist: Of course. Same time next Thursday.
Client: Perfect, thank you. Gotta run!
Therapist: Take care, Jordan.
